<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,488.63.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,488.63.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange finished officially at a new record high of 6,488.63 points, up 28.50, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 3.306 billion forints, down from 7.095 billion forints on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
